{"availability":"available","full":"finley1tree-wq/stock-agent","name":"stock-agent","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-08T04:17:30Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:37:02Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stock-agent-swart.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://stock-agent-swart.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.038Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.038Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.038Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.038Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Out of the box the agent trades a pretend $400 portfolio (BROKER=sim). Real prices, real signals, real decisions — fake money. It buys and sells, tracks every position's weight and profit, books realised P/L, and rewrites portfolio.md after every check so you can see exactly what it would have done with your money. Every Monday it adds another pretend $400, mirroring the real plan (sim.weeklydeposit in config.yaml; set it to 0 for a one-time $400 test)."],"features":["portfolio-board.html — the phone dashboard (already built). Add to home screen.","agent/ — runs every 30 minutes while the US market is open. At each check it gathers prices, headlines, Congress disclosures and SEC insider filings, asks Claude whether to deploy any of the week's $400 right now and…","Guardrails in config.yaml that the AI cannot override (max per ticker, max per day, max orders and sells per day, minimum hold before selling, no same-day sell-and-rebuy, min order)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/finley1tree-wq/stock-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a0369f89c20c558b201770bd740718e986e24019d2fe7508d077d5054f90c051","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.192Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.192Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Out of the box the agent trades a pret